    <h1>How Do You Actually Make Videos With <em>Claude Code?</em></h1>
    <p class="dek">Yes, it works. But the tutorials skip the parts that decide whether it works for you: which of the three paths you are actually on, the license that quietly starts at four employees, why the narration drifts out of sync, and how long a render really takes.</p>
