      <li><a href="https://github.com/haidrrrry/claude-remotion-skill" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">haidrrrry/claude-remotion-skill</a>: the deterministic-versus-generative framing quoted above.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="toolsrow">Related reading from Best Answer Hub: <a href="/playbooks/ai-agents-vs-automation/">AI agents vs automation</a>, <a href="/playbooks/ai-tools-worth-paying-for/">which AI tools are worth paying for</a>, and the free <a href="/tools/">Best Answer Hub tools</a>. The finished pipeline lives at <a href="/ai-agent-skills/">AI Agent Skills</a>.</p>
